   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>PDU Router (PduR)</h2><p class=\"lead\">The PDU Router routes I-PDUs between communication interfaces, transport protocols, and upper layers without payload inspection.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00334\">PduR_Init</a> (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00743\">PduR_PBConfigType</a>* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the PDU Router</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00338\">PduR_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versionInfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00771\">PduR_PBConfigIdType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00341\">PduR_GetConfigurationId</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the unique identifier of the post-build time configuration of the PDU Router</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00615\">PduR_EnableRouting</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00654\">PduR_RoutingPathGroupIdType</a> id);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Enables a routing path group.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00617\">PduR_DisableRouting</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00654\">PduR_RoutingPathGroupIdType</a> id, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> initialize);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Disables a routing path group.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00743\">PduR_PBConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Data structure containing post-build-time configuration data of the PDU Router.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00771\">PduR_PBConfigIdType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Identification of the post-build configuration currently used for routing I-PDUs.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00654\">PduR_RoutingPathGroupIdType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Identification of a Routing Table</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_PduR_00742\">PduR_StateType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">States of the PDU Router</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
